    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"a single, small act of surrender\"... what does that even mean? like, just giving up on my career? i feel like everything i've ever worked for is tied to this cycle. if i surrender, i'm just letting the whole thing win. i don't see how there's any real release. it's like the only way to actually stop the noise is for everything to just... end. is that even a thing people think about? to just just stop everything permanently?",
